text":": "},{"text":"Attributes","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:15PushwooshBridge16PWLiveActivitiesP0a4LiveD0E5setupyyqd__mAD0aE18ActivityAttributesRd__lFZ0H0L_qd__mfp"},{"text":".Type) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Attributes","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","preciseIdentifier":"s:23PushwooshLiveActivities0aB18ActivityAttributesP"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your custom attributes type conforming to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"activityType"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method sets up automatic token registration and activity lifecycle management","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for your custom "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" type."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this for "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"every"}]},{"type":"text","text":" attributes type you use, at app launch — in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)"},{"type":"text","text":" (or the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"App.init"},{"type":"text","text":" for SwiftUI apps)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is what re-attaches the SDK to activities that are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"already running"}]},{"type":"text","text":" at launch and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-uploads their per-activity push token to the server, so remote updates keep working after"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a cold start — including an activity that started (or was scheduled to start) while the app was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"terminated. This is a required, one-time-per-launch call, not tied to any screen: ActivityKit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exposes running activities only through the concrete "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Activity<Attributes>"},{"text":" generic and does","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not persist the set of types across launches, so the SDK cannot reconnect a type it hasn’t been","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"told about in the current session. Registering a type lazily (e.g. in a view’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"onAppear","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"means the server can’t update that activity until that screen is opened. The call is idempotent,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"so registering at launch and again per-screen is safe."}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/pushwooshliveactivitiesimplementationsetup\/setup(_:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup\/setup(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshL